<div class="bg-ash-bg">

  <div class="px-7 pt-14 pb-10 text-center space-y-5 border-b border-ash-border">
    <div class="w-24 h-[50px] mx-auto overflow-hidden flex items-start justify-center">
      <%= image_tag "https://cgm-production-images.s3.ap-northeast-1.amazonaws.com/default/cgm-logo.png", alt: "カタログギフトメーカーのロゴ", class: "w-24 flex-shrink-0" %>
    </div>
    <p class="text-xs font-serif text-gold-dark tracking-widest">自分でつくるWEBカタログギフト</p>
    <h1 class="font-serif text-2xl font-bold text-ash-text leading-relaxed">
      贈りものを、<br>選ぶ楽しさごと届けよう。
    </h1>
    <p class="text-xs text-ash-sub font-light leading-[2.2] max-w-xs mx-auto">
      ブランドやお店にしばられず、自由に組み合わせて。<br>あなたが選んだものだけの、オリジナルカタログギフトです。
    </p>
    <div class="pt-3">
      <% if user_signed_in? %>
        <%= link_to gift_lists_path, class: "px-8 py-3.5 text-white font-serif text-xs tracking-widest shadow-md btn-gold-subtle transition inline-flex items-center space-x-2" do %>
          <span>ギフトリストを作成</span>
          <i data-lucide="arrow-right" class="w-3.5 h-3.5"></i>
        <% end %>
      <% else %>
        <%= link_to new_user_session_path, class: "px-8 py-3.5 text-white font-serif text-xs tracking-widest shadow-md btn-gold-subtle transition inline-flex items-center space-x-2" do %>
          <span>はじめる</span>
          <i data-lucide="arrow-right" class="w-3.5 h-3.5"></i>
        <% end %>
      <% end %>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="px-7 pt-9 pb-2 space-y-4 max-w-md mx-auto">
    <div class="space-y-1.5 text-center">
      <div class="flex items-center justify-center space-x-4">
        <div class="h-px w-8 bg-gold/40"></div>
        <span class="text-xs font-serif text-gold-dark tracking-widest">こんなお悩み、ありませんか？</span>
        <div class="h-px w-8 bg-gold/40"></div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="bg-white p-3 border border-ash-border shadow-[0_2px_16px_-4px_rgba(0,0,0,0.03)]">
      <%= image_tag "https://cgm-production-images.s3.ap-northeast-1.amazonaws.com/default/cgm-img1.png", alt: "プレゼント選びに悩む人のイラスト", class: "w-full h-auto" %>
    </div>

    <div class="text-center px-6 pt-2 space-y-1.5">
      <p class="font-serif text-base font-bold text-ash-text">その悩み、相手に選んでもらえば解決します。</p>
      <p class="text-xs text-ash-sub font-light leading-relaxed">候補をいくつか並べておくだけ。あとは、相手が好きなものを選んでくれます。</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="pt-9 pb-2 space-y-4">
    <div class="space-y-1.5 text-center px-7">
      <div class="flex items-center justify-center space-x-4">
        <div class="h-px w-8 bg-gold/40"></div>
        <span class="text-xs font-serif text-gold-dark tracking-widest">カタログギフトメーカーだからできること</span>
        <div class="h-px w-8 bg-gold/40"></div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="flex overflow-x-auto no-scrollbar snap-x snap-mandatory gap-4 px-7 pb-2 max-w-md mx-auto
      md:max-w-2xl md:overflow-visible md:flex-wrap md:snap-none md:justify-center md:px-0">
      <div class="snap-start flex-shrink-0 w-[85%] sm:w-80 md:w-72 bg-white border border-ash-border shadow-[0_2px_16px_-4px_rgba(0,0,0,0.03)]">
        <%= image_tag "https://cgm-production-images.s3.ap-northeast-1.amazonaws.com/default/cgm-img2.png", alt: "好きなブランドやショップを自由に組み合わせられるイラスト", class: "w-full h-auto" %>
        <div class="p-4 space-y-1">
          <h2 class="font-serif text-sm font-semibold text-ash-text">組み合わせ自由</h2>
          <p class="text-xs text-ash-sub font-light leading-relaxed">特定のショップやブランドに縛られないから、あなたらしいセレクトができます。</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="snap-start flex-shrink-0 w-[85%] sm:w-80 md:w-72 bg-white border border-ash-border shadow-[0_2px_16px_-4px_rgba(0,0,0,0.03)]">
        <%= image_tag "https://cgm-production-images.s3.ap-northeast-1.amazonaws.com/default/cgm-img3.png", alt: "受け取った相手が嬉しそうに商品を選ぶイラスト", class: "w-full h-auto" %>
        <div class="p-4 space-y-1">
          <h2 class="font-serif text-sm font-semibold text-ash-text">もらう側も嬉しい</h2>
          <p class="text-xs text-ash-sub font-light leading-relaxed">リストの中から欲しいものを選べるから、贈られる側の満足度も上がります。</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="pt-9 pb-2 space-y-4" data-controller="carousel">
    <div class="space-y-1.5 text-center px-7">
      <div class="flex items-center justify-center space-x-4">
        <div class="h-px w-8 bg-gold/40"></div>
        <span class="text-xs font-serif text-gold-dark tracking-widest">使い方</span>
        <div class="h-px w-8 bg-gold/40"></div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div data-carousel-target="scroller" class="flex overflow-x-auto no-scrollbar snap-x snap-mandatory gap-4 px-7 pb-1 max-w-md mx-auto
      md:max-w-4xl md:overflow-visible md:flex-wrap md:snap-none md:justify-center md:px-7">
      <div class="snap-start flex-shrink-0 w-[72%] sm:w-64 bg-white border border-ash-border p-6 space-y-2.5">
        <span class="font-en text-2xl text-gold/50 font-medium">01</span>
        <h3 class="font-serif text-sm font-semibold text-ash-text">贈りものの候補を集める</h3>
        <p class="text-xs text-ash-sub font-light leading-relaxed">気になった商品を、いくつでも自由に追加できます。URLを貼るだけで簡単に登録できます。</p>
      </div>
      <div class="snap-start flex-shrink-0 w-[72%] sm:w-64 bg-white border border-ash-border p-6 space-y-2.5">
        <span class="font-en text-2xl text-gold/50 font-medium">02</span>
        <h3 class="font-serif text-sm font-semibold text-ash-text">カタログギフトを送る</h3>
        <p class="text-xs text-ash-sub font-light leading-relaxed">できあがったカタログのURLを、LINEなどで送るだけ。受け取る相手はログイン不要です。</p>
      </div>
      <div class="snap-start flex-shrink-0 w-[72%] sm:w-64 bg-white border border-ash-border p-6 space-y-2.5">
        <span class="font-en text-2xl text-gold/50 font-medium">03</span>
        <h3 class="font-serif text-sm font-semibold text-ash-text">相手がギフトを選ぶ</h3>
        <p class="text-xs text-ash-sub font-light leading-relaxed">受け取った相手が、カタログの中から気に入った一つを選びます。</p>
      </div>
      <div class="snap-start flex-shrink-0 w-[72%] sm:w-64 bg-white border border-ash-border p-6 space-y-2.5">
        <span class="font-en text-2xl text-gold/50 font-medium">04</span>
        <h3 class="font-serif text-sm font-semibold text-ash-text">贈り主に通知が届く</h3>
        <p class="text-xs text-ash-sub font-light leading-relaxed">選ばれると贈り主に通知が届くので、選び終わるまで待つだけです。</p>
      </div>
      <div class="snap-start flex-shrink-0 w-[72%] sm:w-64 bg-white border border-ash-border p-6 space-y-2.5">
        <span class="font-en text-2xl text-gold/50 font-medium">05</span>
        <h3 class="font-serif text-sm font-semibold text-ash-text">購入してプレゼント</h3>
        <p class="text-xs text-ash-sub font-light leading-relaxed">選ばれた商品を、贈り主が購入・発送すれば完了です。</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="flex justify-center gap-1.5 pt-1 md:hidden">
      <span data-carousel-target="dot" class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-gold"></span>
      <span data-carousel-target="dot" class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-ash-border"></span>
      <span data-carousel-target="dot" class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-ash-border"></span>
      <span data-carousel-target="dot" class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-ash-border"></span>
      <span data-carousel-target="dot" class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-ash-border"></span>
    </div>

    <p class="text-[10px] text-ash-sub font-light text-center px-7">※本サービスに購入機能はありません</p>
  </div>

  <footer class="px-7 py-6 text-center border-t border-ash-border">
    <p class="text-[10px] text-ash-sub font-light">© カタログギフトメーカー</p>
  </footer>
</div>
